WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.546
Here is a class poster. Its file size is three megabytes. We want to know the size in kilobytes.

00:00:07.546 --> 00:00:16.431
One megabyte is one thousand kilobytes. Three groups of one thousand make three thousand. Click three thousand kilobytes.

00:00:16.431 --> 00:00:21.023
Check your answer. Always read the unit beside the number.
